From 4656878f3c179426b9dce8727ff35b53c98fb6b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Julian=20R=C3=BCth?= <julian.rueth@fsfe.org>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 01:46:43 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Work around https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/pull/165129
 which breaks ASM on Clang 21 targeting macOS

---
